# Universal Highlight Engine™ (#006)

Platform-wide — every Squares sport. Rewards **moments**, not scores. Never affects cash prizes.

## Highlight Squares

4–8 random occupied squares assigned **after** number reveal. Not purchasable. Auditable.

## Registry

One event registry — sports register events. No engine forks.

## On activation

Board darkens → glow → pulse → reward → XP/timeline/legacy/activity/Huddle. Automatic.

## Discovery

Tooltip only at first notice — keep mystery.

## Fairness

Random, transparent, immutable assignment log. Trust first.

